<!-- GAL 第 4 块测试语料：Switch 着色器（nxsh_extract 抽出的 Maxwell 机器码）→ Ryujinx 翻译器（TargetApi.Vulkan、按 Gpu 层的描述符集分配）→ SPIR-V + 程序资源布局。 -->
<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <OutputType>Exe</OutputType>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <Nullable>disable</Nullable>
    <AllowUnsafeBlocks>true</AllowUnsafeBlocks>
    <RyuSrc Condition="'$(RyuSrc)' == ''">$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)../../../../compat/tree</RyuSrc>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="$(RyuSrc)/src/Ryujinx.Graphics.Shader/Ryujinx.Graphics.Shader.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="$(RyuSrc)/src/Ryujinx.Common/Ryujinx.Common.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
